## LineChart

Generic multi-series SVG line chart with hover tooltip, per-series toggle chips, and an empty state. Extracted from the mortgage calculator's amortization chart and generalized: series definitions and value formatting are caller-supplied, nothing is currency- or domain-bound.

### Import

```ts
import { LineChart } from '../charts/line-chart';
```

### Usage

```gts
<LineChart
  @data={{this.points}}
  @series={{this.series}}
  @xKey='x'
  @formatX={{this.formatX}}
  @label='Metric samples trend'
/>
```

- `@data` — `Record<string, number>[]`, sorted by the x field.
- `@series` — `{ key, label, color?, dashed? }[]`; colors default to the shared `--chart-N` palette.
- `@xKey` — which field of each point is the x axis (default `'x'`).
- `@formatValue` / `@formatValueShort` / `@formatX` — optional formatters for tooltip values, y-axis ticks, and x labels; defaults are plain locale numbers.
- Renders a dashed 'No data to chart yet' panel when data or series are empty.
